ind":"update","title":"Update 1.1.0 🦀 Waifu Bubble is now compatible with Steam Deck!","summary":"Hi, little crabs! — Patch Notes 1.1.0 🦀 Hi, little crabs! We have great news! The Waifu Bubble demo is now compatible with Steam Deck. 🎮We’ve been working to optimize the game so it runs as well as possible on a wider range of devices. We’ve also fixed several bugs to provide a more stable and enjoyable experience.Steam Deck performanceHere are the performance results we’ve achieved with the different graphics modes:Balanced: stable 30 FPS with excellent graphics. This is our recommended mode!Qu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:34:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042550-1843481262691853","game_id":"steam-5042550","kind":"announcement","title":"The Waifu Bubble Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"Hello, little crabs! 🦀In this demo, you can play the first 6 levels of the game, controlling our adorable little crabs as you help a waifu trapped in a bubble make her way from the depths of the ocean to the surface. You can play solo or team up with a friend in co-op!What's in the demoThe first 6 levels of Waifu BubbleSolo and 1–2 player co-opA taste of our relaxing two-layer puzzle designWhat's not in the demoTo keep the surprise for the full game, the cosmetics for the crabs and the waifu — t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T11:00:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691853","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5042550-1841579228670932","game_id":"steam-5042550","kind":"announcement","title":"New Visual Look for Waifu Bubble","summary":"Hello, little crabs!After an intense period of work on the visuals and rendering of the game, today we want to show you the new visual look that Waifu Bubble will have.During this process, we went through several iterations of the environments, working especially on lighting, materials, colors, and rendering to achieve a more polished look and, above all, a more kawaii style.Map 1 — Iteration 1This is the version we were using as our starting point before beginning the visual overhaul.Map 1 — It","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T07:24:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:01:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5042550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5042550":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5042550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z"},"5080980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:37Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5042550","app_id":5042550,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a74cf28a8295927bca74da05afa5576792c1f5f091686e2d486aa4e51df5fe5c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"사랑스러운 게들과 함께 매력적인 수중 퍼즐 어드벤처에 뛰어드세요! 혼자서도 친구와 함께도, 정교한 2층 구조의 레벨